00:58:28.546 --> 00:58:47.110
slipping slowly out of the window towards the water, until he was only hanging on by his toes, at which moment luckily a sudden loud squawk from Owl, which was really part of the story, being what his aunt said, woke the piglet up, and just gave him time to jerk himself back into safety and say, How interesting!

