01:01:39.864 --> 01:01:52.206
And if Christopher Robin had told them about the floating bear and the brain of poo and all the wonderful ships he had invented and sailed on, and he began to think how awful it would be if everybody had forgotten about it.

01:01:52.266 --> 01:01:55.117
And nobody quite knew what the party was for.

01:01:55.177 --> 01:01:59.298
